        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcuts work in every app. One that macOS also uses is marked and stays off; Rolltop cannot see shortcuts other apps use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快捷键在所有 App 中都有效。与 macOS 冲突的快捷键会被标出并保持停用；Rolltop 无法得知其他 App 使用的快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show and click" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示并点按"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show and right-click" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示并右键点按"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the item for a moment if it is hidden, then clicks it. Needs Device Control and Data Access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果该项已隐藏，会先短暂显示它，然后点按它。需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type shortcut" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入快捷键"
